<body>
    <h1>Employee access product version</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><br></p>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/products/FUM/user=
_story_maps/7314400247717852084" rel=3D"nofollow">User story maps for Firm =
&amp; User Mgmt</a></p>
<p>Nav path: Aha! Epics &gt; User story map, title: Employee access managem=
ent 1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<h2 id=3D"Employeeaccessproductversion-MVPrelease(2026Q3)">MVP release (202=
6 Q3)</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" data-snooker-col-s=
eries=3D"numbers" data-snooker-locked-cols=3D"0" style=3D"width: 94.0901%;"=
>
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 5.64151%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 19.5207%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 34.526%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 16.1347%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 24.1457%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTh" contenteditable=3D"false" da=
ta-mce-resize=3D"false" scope=3D"col"><br></th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Epic</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Enabled Capabilities</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Key Outcome</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Notes</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd" contenteditable=3D"false" da=
ta-mce-resize=3D"false">1</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Backfill Remaining User Pack=
ages for Employee Access + Fix TA&nbsp;</span><a class=3D"external-link" hr=
ef=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/features/FUM-432" rel=3D"nofollow" style=3D"lette=
r-spacing: 0.0px;">FUM-432</a><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> and</=
span><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> </span><a class=3D"external-li=
nk" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/features/FUM-437" rel=3D"nofollow" style=3D=
"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">FUM-437</a></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>1. New user packages required for employee access are enabled:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ce1c0053-108b-4b6f-a8e4-6ea669110e32">Global Admin</=
li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b0e69175-36ec-42fd-af70-110fba9c2f8d">Manage Orders =
and Trades</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1fb207cd-31b4-4e1a-bc40-3ca608c572f4">Manage Users</=
li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"62c7cbcc-dfa8-4a64-830d-ee17fc68342b">Manage User Pa=
sswords</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3ed3aa17-911e-4aef-bd85-b9df3537b9ea">Admin Orders a=
nd Trade</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"51049d15-c861-42a2-92e4-f2fbc5bcbab9">Full Admin Tra=
des</li>
     </ul>
     <p>2. Feature and resource assignments in current user packages are re=
conciled to the access matrix</p>
     <p>3. TA access control are aligned to the user package specification<=
/p>
     <p>4. Trade Support group are re-assigned to the appropriate user pack=
age&nbsp;</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4e4ce25b-844f-45ae-87da-55e99376edac">Ensure all pre=
scribed internal access provisioning according to the Internal access matri=
x are accounted for</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ac75a5ee-7306-4020-a25c-50faa2cf97f5">Ensure the rea=
diness of Trade Allocation product launch</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Dependencies:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"325ea6fa-32b9-4ca2-85d6-8247f91b0b4b">Cross-check pa=
ckage access mappings verse internal access matrix, identifying gaps (if an=
y)&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7a471983-4598-4be4-93f0-23ca0f09fb25">Finalize Admin=
 Transactions access mappings</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd" contenteditable=3D"false" da=
ta-mce-resize=3D"false">2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Primary account provisioning via IIQ <a clas=
s=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/features/FUM-427" rel=3D"no=
follow">FUM-427</a></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>1. Test env of Compass internal access is enabled</p>
     <p>(non-prod IIQ =E2=86=92 CX QA / UAT / PP =E2=86=92 non-prod Okta NB=
C tenant)</p>
     <p>2. FUM data schema and APIs are restructured to support email unici=
ty for all CX users (external users included)</p>
     <p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">3. Refactor Manage DWH user admin pa=
ge&nbsp;</span></p>
     <p>4. Compass Internal access matrix is configured in IIQ</p>
     <p>5. IIQ auto-provisioning of CX primary accounts is enabled for thes=
e use cases:&nbsp;</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4aedab65-f8d6-409a-954e-3b3f4dc647f8">Add access</li=
>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e5d81060-6cd5-41a4-ad65-5d8614aa18d5">Modify access&=
nbsp;</li>
     </ul>
     <p>6. Operation workflow to update linked Ids for CX primary accounts =
is enabled</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9ef55a71-6b13-4fba-8928-f53ffed1f411">Enable E2E Int=
ernal access testing in non-prod env</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"fdbe759f-b438-476e-b2db-03820959db81">Compliant to B=
ank's employee access provisioning standard</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Dependencies:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"28e16c6d-060f-4707-ac51-78d355f393c8">CIAM team and =
IIQ team to support non-prod env setup</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b9947ac0-1e65-4485-a847-926b2262d162">Finalize Inter=
nal access matrix</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"969edca0-0a62-40ba-9547-98f79c5b0f0a">IIQ configurat=
ion: new catalog items, internal access matrix, request &amp; approval rout=
es for access provisioning</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"52afb9a0-52cf-4979-a185-5f8c159402eb">CX-IIQ endpoin=
ts for access provisioning</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd" contenteditable=3D"false" da=
ta-mce-resize=3D"false">3</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">SSO access to platform <a class=3D"external-=
link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/features/FUM-429" rel=3D"nofollow">FUM-42=
9</a></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>1. New Compass internal URL is enabled</p>
     <p>2. Given that their primary account has been set up, employee can s=
ingle signon CX and all integrated apps (excluding SZ apps)</p>
     <p>3. Self-serve user profile mgmt features are hidden, including:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7c954cbb-076f-4a6f-aa3a-439fb26fbcc7">Change Passwor=
d</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3fbfdeda-e130-4332-88d2-7e138a957007">Change 2FA</li=
>
      <li data-uuid=3D"6c8e0aec-ceef-4f3d-af3f-176553b246aa">Change Securit=
y Question</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"485bb99c-5bf3-4824-b87e-f22b3077179b">Enhance Employ=
ee CX login &amp; access experience&nbsp;</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Dependencies:&nbsp;</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"d7200147-6698-4901-9b6d-267dc6a54f71">DevOps to supp=
ort new internal URL setup</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"255ba545-302c-4da0-921f-9b6e6c59bdc2">Integrated sys=
tems (e.g. IIS apps) to handle employee access.. GIC-M app is TBD</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ff06b497-5cdd-405e-bebb-b30724b8af79">Activation tea=
m and IIQ to collaborate on CX employee account initial load (~260)</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd" contenteditable=3D"false" da=
ta-mce-resize=3D"false">4</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">User account deactivation for primary accoun=
ts <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/features/FUM-428"=
 rel=3D"nofollow">FUM-428</a></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>1. IIQ auto-deprovisioning of CX primary accounts is enabled for th=
ese use cases:&nbsp;</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f19460f7-a21f-44ae-ad67-8a5670fbef9d">Remove access<=
/li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8a138d7e-a43e-4c1f-af3d-61a8c15212a1">Employee depar=
ture</li>
     </ul>
     <p>2. Auto-deactivating linked secondary ID and all additional ID's</p=
></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"babb9f3a-12df-404c-bc49-affea9e4de78">Compliant to B=
ank's employee access de-provisioning standard</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Dependencies:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"c62a7c68-478f-4f2d-8234-5c37a1aba77e">IIQ configurat=
ion: new catalog items, internal access matrix, request &amp; approval rout=
es for access de-provisioning&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a1bf997a-f424-4ccd-989f-7752eba5c754">CX-IIQ endpoin=
ts for access de-provisioning</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd" contenteditable=3D"false" da=
ta-mce-resize=3D"false">5</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">User certifications for primary accounts onl=
y <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/features/FUM-426" =
rel=3D"nofollow">FUM-426</a></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>1. IIQ ongoing employee monitoring and the annual employee access c=
ertification are set up</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"50c14cc6-918a-49d9-b427-2d77fca6a6d3">Ensure that se=
condary ID and all additional ID's will be linked to the primary ID and app=
ear on the report</li>
     </ul>
     <p>2. Rule to deactivate user access after 90-day inactivity is enforc=
ed</p>
     <p><br></p>
     <p><br></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"90f39a2d-be74-4290-8726-67829241c93e">Compliant to B=
ank's employee access monitoring standard</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Dependencies:&nbsp;</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"098a6711-dc36-459e-bddf-2d85b3e166b5">Locate the res=
ponsible team to set up IIQ ongoing monitoring and annual access certificat=
ion</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b6ef1521-1378-4d82-ab54-c0bfe124a2bd">Detail design =
on how to implement the 90-day inactivity rule&nbsp;</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd" contenteditable=3D"false" da=
ta-mce-resize=3D"false">6</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">One-time initial load <a class=3D"external-l=
ink" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/features/FUM-452" rel=3D"nofollow">FUM-452=
</a></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"aea365b2-58e6-4114-920a-fbe495edfb53"><span>All in-s=
cope employees with existing Compass access in internal firms (COR or NBIN)=
 are transitioned to a single primary account provisioned through IIQ.</spa=
n></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"d0191b0d-5cda-4621-826e-cff56a5f9c1e"><span><span>Ex=
isting DWH access is preserved and re-applied where required during account=
 creation or update.</span></span></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"550ad445-4834-485f-bf0b-95862c3dcf54"><span>External=
 employee user IDs are sunset so they are no longer visible in User admin, =
usable on the Login page, or maintainable by admins.</span></li>
     </ol></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul style=3D"text-align: left;">
      <li data-uuid=3D"fc76bf46-0fa7-4ad6-a662-353be43fbf7f">Primary employ=
ee accounts of all listed users are successfully set up&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3ee26595-3f2e-495a-bb85-a3165bdee0dd">External user =
accounts of the employees are not accessible anymore</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8e5bdffd-3525-4b3e-ae5e-aa76bb0317b6">If existed pre=
viously, employees' DWH app access are not impacted</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Dependencies:</p>
     <ul style=3D"text-align: left;">
      <li data-uuid=3D"13ba1ffa-1b24-4a61-b125-dcb9aed29df4">NBIN internal =
access matrix is finalized and configured in IIQ</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b8276cf6-cea3-48e3-a4db-9b8cc529aabd">Tech integrati=
on between IIQ and FUM has been completed</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<h2 id=3D"Employeeaccessproductversion-PostMVPrelease(Descopedfrom2026Q3&am=
p;Q4)">Post MVP release (Descoped from 2026Q3 &amp; Q4)</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" data-snooker-col-s=
eries=3D"numbers" data-snooker-locked-cols=3D"0" style=3D"width: 100.636%;"=
>
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 4.91471%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 23.4923%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 31.6507%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 18.381%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 21.5264%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTh" contenteditable=3D"false" da=
ta-mce-resize=3D"false" scope=3D"col"><br></th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Epic</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Enabled Capabilities</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Key Outcome</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Notes</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd" contenteditable=3D"false" da=
ta-mce-resize=3D"false">1</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Firm &amp; User admin tool update <a class=
=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/features/FUM-447" rel=3D"nof=
ollow">FUM-447</a></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>1. User Directory display is enabled on Firm Settings&nbsp;</p>
     <p>2. Page layouts of User List and User Details are re-arranged (univ=
ersal)</p>
     <p>3. Primary account details are enriched&nbsp;</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"abc16f6a-0067-4b31-ad75-01e4d2cfea40">Enhance firm a=
nd user admin experience&nbsp;</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><br></p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd" contenteditable=3D"false" da=
ta-mce-resize=3D"false">2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Secondary account provisioning, deactivation=
 and certification <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/f=
eatures/FUM-431" rel=3D"nofollow">FUM-431</a></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>1. MyIT request flows to request new, modify or remove additional C=
X employee access are enabled</p>
     <p>2. Both New Employee creation workflow and New User creation workfl=
ow are supported</p>
     <p>3. Additional account changes (profile details, role, data access, =
assigned firm,...) are enabled</p>
     <p>4. Rule to deactivate user access after 90-day inactivity is enforc=
ed</p>
     <p>5. User access certification on additional accounts is enforced&nbs=
